      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10033"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a98b5cd2699d3c5b584b17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，我叫雪之美人！\\n在闪耀系列赛中大放光彩，成为憧憬的城市女孩\\n这就是我的梦想！呼……好好的说出来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8c28370c80a47d2dea23ae4fde855e0174e166fe41960bd07e9c160737af9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10034"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10034"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063a55be46840ccdf021e9ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Hello Hello～！我是艾尼斯风神！\\n为了让家人们都感到高兴，\\n无论是比赛还是打工我都会全力以赴～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f43edfbb348655d542aa8891a44521046886bc5ecf46e140824ed61c6bb5d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10035"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10035"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc0ab7e827726a9c0a3969f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你对赛马娘的速度究竟能快到什么程度也不感兴趣吗。\\n但如果你对此有兴趣的话……就请成为我，\\n爱丽速子的豚鼠吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b6dd26d368d0637d7b85bd3cf5ba46643a7dca3e1c210d9c531691ce9d1656",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10036"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10036"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c0a90029d742fa65a5b23c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我叫空中神宫。无论什么比赛数据都是关键。\\n模拟推导没有问题的话，就能够制服对手。\\n在逻辑上来说啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fdde6989f5c0f7d3f07d20373e8ddecc599f93303876b47080c96dc3ee6738",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10037"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10037"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c20ce0377b5e57fa30ef38c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫荣进闪耀。\\n为了守护赛马娘的传统，我会继续奔跑。\\n无论是任何比赛都会按日程表定下的节奏完美进行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d343ef0753153a4481e9a3a940eb0e0b71427d5a39552f22b39b142c348c5d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10038"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10038"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52a561cd4fab7b647258ffd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是醒目飞鹰！请叫我飞鹰子吧！\\n我的梦想是成为马娘偶像！\\n要签名的话一直都欢迎哟☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e473a53ae02f72c797ee84d3c60a1a2443557d173b77ed00bfc2ce0ed1f755f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10039"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10039"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0701bf3e4f4e8e1a0c0f89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田大进。就这些。\\n我只想赢下比赛，让那些看不起\\n我的家伙好好看着。……不要管我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "925fea43aba338e546116720ec6e16db1801b78ec6c8ef00178a0401a447c364",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10040"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10040"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e5faa81ba28314cd9d84f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫西野花。\\n我想成为大家都信赖着的\\n优秀姐姐赛马娘……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddff35581ff0c9ac7cfc37bfba54cf16bc1985839377509c20a760062c6a274",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10041"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10041"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3ed486155ee85c6d0c6816",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正义的英雄，微光飞驹参上！\\n无论是怎样的强敌，我的跑法都能够“砰”地将其打败，\\n夺回大家的笑容！很厉害吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e512a5605cb724a5e00b138ed5751331761b0feaed6c014922b9800ea708d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10042"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10042"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4176184abce0c7b17a3d867c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗨嗨，我是美丽周日！\\n向全世界传递Marvelous的感觉！\\n那么，大家也一起，Marvelous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7e307eb45c87bab8103a1f9b21b38d41e941f9dd0facaaef41fb47140048c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10043"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10043"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b845a901b84a3522db7b90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫待兼福来！\\n相信着Shiraoki大人的神启，等待着福到来的日子……\\n无论日夜都努力占卜着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd22d4f2503703ae5f058a0164e7beda108f17f2f8384cd5e87e7870dca47347",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10044"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10044"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49762b9b252cd83b6cf04a31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，我叫名将怒涛……！这个、那个，\\n我、我想变得对自己有自信\\n我会尽我所能，努李（力）……咬、咬到舌头了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbc189c802e2c9605e95f32d06e65103213f018118e44ab37d93aae24c02bef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10045"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10045"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3bc5d6fa2d8d2ce5943f110",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你好……那个，我是目白多伯。\\n我也是目白家的赛马娘，正因如此要做到\\n无愧于目白之名的奔跑……我是这么想的",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f650247a8aa60524c4de9a86b2ae3a85a96aba186ea031b37869de0476b8de3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10046"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/88/10046"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d1610da3a14b3382bcf920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……我是优秀素质。\\n啊哈哈，果然“优秀素质”这名字\\n名过其实了吧……嘛，就一点一点的来吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e95a47d429cbba26a494cbb92ee8df5637993c05c4acea31adb6b7f9060eac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
